          "workplan_notes": "$50,000 distributed to 114 of 115 credit colleges and 4 noncredit campuses for CPL implementation. $6M one-time fully allocated. 2026 advocacy active for $2M ongoing + $35M one-time appropriation.",
          "update": "SB 135 and AB 135 were enacted, providing $7 million in ongoing funding for CPL Initiative operations, technical assistance, faculty workgroups, technology development, partnerships, and intersegmental collaboration, plus $35 million to support college awards based on CPL outcomes, projects, and innovations. The Chancellor's Office has drafted a two-year college funding model, with finalization expected in August 2026, field deployment in October 2026, and first disbursements planned for November or December 2026. Link to bills: https://legiscan.com/CA/text/AB135/id/3044016",
