      "update": "The Futuro Health CPL project completed Phase 1 (Project Launch and CPL Design) in September 2026 and is transitioning into Phase 2, having established governance, developed a tiered crosswalk identifying five priority colleges (Merritt, City College of San Francisco, North Orange Continuing Education, Sacramento City, and Contra Costa) with aligned courses, and secured an ACE credit recommendation for three lower-division units for the Human Touch Healthcare program. Key next steps for Q3 include initiating faculty outreach at the five priority colleges, advancing articulation work for HTH and Medi-Cal Peer Support Specialist, finalizing the data-sharing MOU, and preparing student-facing CPL communications once HTH approval is obtained.",
